# The odin-rdf-* projects are separate GitHub repositories, checked out here as
# siblings purely for local development: the family's Makefiles and ols.json
# reach each other through relative collections (-collection:rdf=../odin-rdf-parser,
# -collection:store=../odin-rdf-store), so they must live side by side on disk.
# They are not part of this repository.
odin-rdf-*/

